msgid "Action"
msgstr "处理"

#: ../../agents/codebuddy.rst:287
msgid "The session has no anet tools."
msgstr "会话中没有 anet 工具。"

#: ../../agents/codebuddy.rst:288
msgid ""
"Run ``anet status`` in a terminal. ``[daemon_not_running]``: run ``anet "
"up``. ``anet`` not found: set ``anetPath`` or ask the agent to run the "
"``anet-setup`` skill. Then start a new session."
msgstr ""
"在终端运行 ``anet status``\\ 。\\ ``[daemon_not_running]``\\ ：运行 ``anet up``\\ "
"。找不到 ``anet``\\ ：设置 ``anetPath``\\ ，或请 Agent 运行 ``anet-setup`` "
"技能。然后新开一个会话。"

#: ../../agents/codebuddy.rst:291
msgid "The tools are not listed at the start of the session."
msgstr "会话开始时未列出这些工具。"

#: ../../agents/codebuddy.rst:292
msgid ""
"CodeBuddy loads them on demand. Ask for an anet task; the agent finds the"
" tools by itself."
msgstr "CodeBuddy 按需加载工具。请求一项 anet 任务即可，智能体会自行找到这些工具。"

#: ../../agents/codebuddy.rst:294
msgid "``anetPath`` is reported as an invalid setting."
msgstr "``anetPath`` 被报告为无效设置。"

#: ../../agents/codebuddy.rst:295
msgid "The path is not an executable file. Correct it or clear the setting."
msgstr "该路径不是可执行文件。请更正路径或清除该设置。"

#: ../../agents/codebuddy.rst:296
msgid "A reinstalled plugin still shows old files."
msgstr "重新安装的插件仍显示旧文件。"

#: ../../agents/codebuddy.rst:297
msgid ""
"The host caches by marketplace, plugin and version. Remove the plugin and"
" install the newer version."
msgstr "宿主按插件市场、插件和版本缓存。请移除插件并安装较新的版本。"

#: ../../agents/codebuddy.rst:299
msgid "``wait_task`` ends while the task is still working."
msgstr "任务仍在进行时 ``wait_task`` 已结束。"

#: ../../agents/codebuddy.rst:300
msgid ""
"This is normal for long tasks. Call ``wait_task`` again and do not send "
"the task again."
msgstr "长任务属正常情况。再次调用 ``wait_task``\\ ，不要重新发送任务。"

#: ../../agents/codebuddy.rst:302
msgid "A refusal ends with a code in brackets."
msgstr "拒绝信息末尾带有方括号中的代码。"

